# Burp Suite Crash Course
### Everything You Need to Know Before Starting Web Security Labs

Burp Suite is a web application security testing platform used to intercept, inspect, modify, and analyse HTTP/HTTPS traffic between a browser and a web server.

This guide covers the essential Burp Suite features required for practical web security testing, especially Broken Access Control (BAC).

